# The spec snapshot in provider-dev/downloaded/ IS committed: Fivetran
# serves a single unversioned OpenAPI document, so committing the (collapsed,
# pretty-printed) snapshot makes every refresh a reviewable diff against the
# hash pin in provider-dev/config/spec_pin.json.

# integration test registry copies (rebuilt every run)
tests/integration/.registry-tmp/
tests/integration/.registry-docs-tmp/
tests/integration/.registry-probe-tmp/
